# epaper-linux-aarch64

The generic hosted AArch64 board with its MCU and screen pointed at the
emulated SSD1680, the same two rebindings as epaper-linux-x86_64 on the other
architecture. Everything else is inherited: the same SDK, the same named
device map, and the same RTC and IMU providers.
